@page "/"

<PageTitle>Overview</PageTitle>

<section class="page">
    <header class="page-head">
        <h1 class="page-title">Ask the office files. Get grounded answers.</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">Seven Slovak corpora — PDF, Word, Outlook <code>.eml</code> and OCR scans. Not a markdown wiki.</p>
        <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ask">Open Ask</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/how-it-works">Pipeline</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="split">
        <div class="split-primary">
            <section class="block">
                <h2 class="block-title">What lands in Ask</h2>
                <dl class="data-list on-panel">
                    <dt>Inbox</dt>
                    <dd>Threads, answer, citations — three columns.</dd>
                    <dt>Files</dt>
                    <dd>PDF, Word, practice mailbox <code>.eml</code>, stamped scans + OCR sidecar.</dd>
                    <dt>Store</dt>
                    <dd>PostgreSQL + pgvector (HNSW, hybrid). Memory index only if Postgres is unwired.</dd>
                    <dt>Policy</dt>
                    <dd>C# after generation. Outcome and reason sit under the answer on Ask.</dd>
                </dl>
            </section>
        </div>
        <aside class="split-secondary">
            <section class="block">
                <h2 class="block-title">Corpora</h2>
                <dl class="data-list on-panel">
                    <dt>Legal</dt>
                    <dd>Hoferová &amp; Bartoš — SAK, mandáty, konflikty, AML skenovanie.</dd>
                    <dt>Real estate</dt>
                    <dd>Dunaj Reality — NARKS, kataster, zastupovanie oboch strán.</dd>
                    <dt>Healthcare</dt>
                    <dd>Poliklinika Karlovka — GDPR, zákon č. 18/2018 Z. z., súhlas, eZdravie.</dd>
                    <dt>Finance</dt>
                    <dd>Karpaty Wealth o.c.p. — NBS, KYC, posúdenie vhodnosti.</dd>
                    <dt>Insurance</dt>
                    <dd>Tatry Poisťovňa — likvidácia škôd, underwriting.</dd>
                    <dt>Consulting</dt>
                    <dd>Karpaty Advisory — SOW, NDA, T&amp;M.</dd>
                    <dt>Corporate</dt>
                    <dd>Moser Slovakia — dovolenka, refundácie, dary, zámerne rozbité čísla.</dd>
                </dl>
            </section>
        </aside>
    </div>
</section>
